Package: sosspeech
Title: US Secretary of State Speech Corpus
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ben", "Yoel", , "benjaminyoel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A corpus of speeches delivered by US Secretaries of State,
    distributed as a tidy data frame with speech-level metadata and full text.
    sos_load() downloads the latest weekly release from GitHub (or a fixed
    release, for replication) and caches it locally.
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    readr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
